<p>Sean Rakidzich teaches students how to build an Airbnb business without owning property. His model centers on rental arbitrage, where you lease properties from landlords and relist them as short-term rentals, and co-hosting, where you manage someone else's property for a percentage of revenue. He also covers corporate housing as an additional revenue stream.</p>
