<p>It is worth noting that Karlton Dennis is primarily a content creator and educator. His brand is built on YouTube, social media, and his courses. Tax Alchemy is an education and coaching business, not a tax preparation or CPA firm. The strategies he teaches are sound, but the implementation still falls on you and your own tax professional.</p>

