<p>Once you are accepted as a client, the team begins market analysis and property sourcing. They identify markets with strong STR demand, favorable regulations, and attractive acquisition economics. They analyze specific properties based on projected nightly rates, occupancy rates, operating expenses, and expected cash-on-cash returns. When they identify a property that meets their criteria, they present it to you with full financial projections, tax analysis, and a recommended offer strategy.</p>
