<p>Once the property is live, BnB Accelerator provides ongoing professional management. Guest communications, booking management, cleaning coordination, maintenance, pricing optimization, listing updates, and performance reporting are all handled by the management team. You receive regular reports on occupancy, revenue, expenses, and net income. Your involvement is limited to reviewing these reports and cashing the checks.</p>

