<p>The clients who get the most value from <a href="https://bnbaccelerator.com">BnB Accelerator</a> are those who have the financial resources to invest in quality properties, the income to benefit significantly from STR tax strategies, and the professional demands that make passive ownership far more valuable than hands-on management.</p>

