<p>The STR industry is crowded with service providers, but most of them specialize in only one piece of the investment process. Brokerages help you buy. Designers help you furnish. Managers help you operate. CPAs help you file taxes. Each of these specialists does their job in isolation, and the investor is left to coordinate between them, fill the gaps, and hope that all the pieces work together.</p>
