<p>The other major differentiator is ownership. Unlike syndications and funds, you own the property directly. Your name is on the deed. You control the asset. You can sell it when you want, refinance it when it makes sense, or pass it to your heirs. And because you own it directly, you receive all the tax benefits, including the ability to offset W2 income with STR losses through proper structuring and material participation documentation.</p>

