<p>The done-for-you model also means you are trusting a team with significant decisions about your investment. While you retain approval authority over every major decision, you are relying on the team's expertise for market selection, property evaluation, design choices, and management decisions. Investors who want granular control over every detail may find this level of delegation uncomfortable.</p>
